{"id": "62410", "title": "夜欢妖妻", "author": "零时雨", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 40, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/62/62410.htm", "intro": "【麦优家族】“过来，取悦我！”男人挑起她尖细的下巴，冷亵的声音没有丝毫回转的余地，她不想反抗，也无力去反抗。\r\n\r\n 她只是不受宠的凌家二小姐，一场意外的相遇，却跳进他精心设计的圈套，成为他的傀儡妻，没有婚礼，没有祝福，有的只是一张限制她自由的结婚证书。\r\n\r\n “我们……离婚吧，”当一次次伤害都成为一道无法挽回的殇，她躺在病床上，扯出一抹极其妖媚的微笑，然后绝情离开。\r\n\r\n 再次相遇，他霸道地搂着她的腰，在她耳际边魅惑般说道，“亲爱的，把我吃干抹净就想跑，没那么简单，毁了我的清白，必须对我负责！”", "base": "files/article/html/62/62410", "chapters": [{"title": "第一部分", "file": "9261186.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二部分", "file": "9261187.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三部分", "file": "9261190.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第四部分", "file": "9261192.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第五部分", "file": "9261194.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第六部分", "file": "9261198.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第七部分", "file": "9261199.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第八部分", "file": "9261201.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第九部分", "file": "9261205.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十部分", "file": "9261207.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11部分", "file": "9261209.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12部分", "file": "9261211.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13部分", "file": "9261213.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14部分", "file": "9261215.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15部分", "file": "9261217.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16部分", "file": "9261220.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17部分", "file": "9261222.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18部分", "file": "9261224.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19部分", "file": "9261227.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20部分", "file": "9261228.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21部分", "file": "9261229.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22部分", "file": "9261230.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23部分", "file": "9261231.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24部分", "file": "926123